---
description: Build, format, and test verification before commits
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Before suggesting any commit:
1. Run `npm run lint` to verify ESLint passes
2. Run `npm run typecheck:server` if anything under `server/` or `shared/` changed
3. Run `npm run test` to execute the Vitest suite (app + server projects) with coverage
4. Run `npm run build` to verify the Angular build passes
5. Run `npm run test:scripts` if anything under `scripts/` changed
6. Do not bypass pre-commit hooks
7. If any step fails, fix the issue before proceeding
